# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
/build/
/dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and tooling caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editors
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local scratch — one-off scripts that are not part of the project
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field session output
#
# Each run of the field node writes artifacts/sessions/<session_id>/ with that
# walk's samples. That is operational data belonging to one outing on one
# board, not repository content: it changes on every power-on and would make
# the working tree dirty after every field test. A session worth keeping as
# evidence is committed deliberately, under docs/evidence/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/sessions/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated dashboard output IS committed on purpose: judges and teammates
# should be able to open the live UI straight from the repo without running
# anything. Rebuild any time with:  python3 -m fieldsense.demo
#
# That is why artifacts/ is not ignored wholesale — only the per-run session
# directory above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local model weights — several hundred MB each, fetched per board.
# See docs/AI_DEPLOYMENT.md for how to place them. Anchored with a leading
# slash so it means the repository-root models/ directory and NOT the
# fieldsense/domain/models/ package, which an unanchored pattern also matches.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/models/
*.gguf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and local secrets. Nothing here should ever reach a commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
